<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id0d0640f4-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd" identifier="/us/usc/t16/s1169"><num value="1169">§ 1169.</num><heading> Regulations</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">The Secretary is authorized to prescribe such regulations as he deems necessary to carry out the provisions of this subchapter.</p>
